 "caption": "ANZ sport runs on renewals.\n\nOf the 679 ANZ deals in our 2026 archive, 198 were renewals or extensions. That is 29.2%, against 18.9% for global deals. ANZ was ahead in eight of the ten months from January to October.\n\nFootball, the AFL and motorsport sit well above that. The NRL is the outlier at 19.8%.\n\nThis is our archive, not the whole market. Read the full story: link in bio\n\n#sportsbusiness #sponsorship #sportsmarketing #partnerships"
